  "body": "Nestled on a generous full site in sought-after Wade River Road, this adorable beach cottage offers the perfect blend of character, sunshine, and future possibilities.\r\n\r\nWarm, welcoming, and filled with natural light, the home features beautiful polished matai; timber floors that add timeless charm and character throughout. The open living spaces flow effortlessly to fantastic outdoor entertaining areas, creating the ideal setting for summer barbecues, family gatherings, or simply relaxing in the sun.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a substantial section, this property presents an exciting opportunity for buyers looking to add value. Whether you're seeking a charming weekend retreat, a first home with potential, or a rewarding renovation project, there's plenty of scope to make it your own.\r\n\r\nAdding even greater appeal is the potential for future subdivision (subject to council approval), making this a smart investment in an area where land is increasingly sought after.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\nCute and character-filled beach cottage\r\nWarm, sunny aspect with excellent natural light\r\nBeautiful polished matai timber floors\r\nGreat indoor-outdoor flow and entertaining spaces\r\nLarge freehold/full site\r\nExciting do-up and value-add opportunity\r\nPotential future subdivision (subject to council approval)\r\nDesirable coastal lifestyle location\r\n\r\nA rare chance to secure a slice of coastal paradise with room to renovate, land to enjoy, and future development potential to explore.\r\n\r\nBring your vision, roll up your sleeves, and unlock the possibilities at 51 Wade River Road.",
